  "Name": "MDW_b1",
  "Description": "

  **NOTE**: Only the host is required to have MEV to add korlok sprouts into the stationary pool.
  
  Inspired by ND, high intensity swarms with a good mix of low & high enemy diversity featuring more HVTs than DL. Grabbers require more hits to flee. Oppressors, bulks & leeches also move significantly faster. Nexus now spawn weakened slashers. Grunt waves spawn periodically.
  
  b21:
  - Grabber damage threshold multiplier reduced from 2.4x to 1.35x

